sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant NSS as NetSuite<br/>SuiteScript
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant SVC as Cloud Run<br/>new-deal-review-agent
    participant TQ as Cloud Tasks<br/>ndra-advance
    participant NS as NetSuite<br/>SuiteQL
    participant AS as Asana
    participant SF as Salesforce
    participant SP as SharePoint

    Note over NSS,SP: Workflow 2 - NetSuite Sales Order and Revenue Arrangement to enriched task + DRS

    NSS->>GW: POST /events/netsuite (Sales Order created)
    GW->>SVC: forward with OIDC token
    SVC->>TQ: enqueue task, name from record id + event type
    SVC-->>NSS: 202 Accepted

    TQ->>SVC: POST /internal/advance (OIDC)
    SVC->>AS: find task by Quote Number (matches any quote in the slash-separated field)
    alt no task found for this quote
        SVC->>SVC: log error and alert, return 200 (nothing to attach a flag to)
    end

    SVC->>NS: SuiteQL - sales order for this quote number
    NS-->>SVC: SO row (amount USD, customer class, document number, project codes)

    Note over SVC,AS: amendment analysis needs the signed quote ONLY -<br/>no dependency on TAF, PO or the master agreement

    alt amendment_checked not yet in Agent stages
        SVC->>SF: download executed (signed) quote PDF
        SVC->>SVC: amendment check - method decided after real samples (open question 20)
        alt amendment detected with high confidence
            SVC->>AS: Order Type = "Amendment - Draft"
            SVC->>AS: Quote Number = "Q-1001 / Q-0988 / Q-0954"
            SVC->>AS: create subtask for cancelled quotes
        else no amendment or low confidence
            SVC->>AS: comment only, leave Order Type alone
        end
        SVC->>AS: Agent stages += amendment_checked
    end

    SVC->>AS: write TCV, Customer Size, SO/RMA number, project codes<br/>(only fields currently empty)
    SVC->>AS: Agent stages += so_enriched

    Note over NSS,SVC: The Revenue Arrangement comes from a MANUAL job.<br/>What fires an event for it is open question 18.

    NSS->>GW: POST /events/netsuite (Revenue Arrangement created) - trigger TBD
    GW->>SVC: forward, enqueue, 202
    TQ->>SVC: POST /internal/advance (OIDC)

    SVC->>NS: SuiteQL - revenue arrangement for this SO
    alt RA exists
        NS-->>SVC: RA number
        SVC->>AS: write RA number, Agent stages += ra_ready
    else RA not visible yet
        SVC-->>TQ: 5xx so the queue retries with backoff
        Note right of TQ: no sweep in the first release, so a waiting RA<br/>advances only on a NetSuite event
    end

    alt TCV >= $250,000 USD and RA present
        SVC->>SP: copy DRS template into customer / New Deals / <month>
        SVC->>NS: export NDT Quote Lines, KR73, KR32
        SVC->>NS: related orders - other SOs >= $500k within 90 days
        SVC->>SVC: build extract tabs<br/>(SF Quote Extract, NS RA Extract, NS Plan Extract)
        SVC->>SVC: review tab checks - all arithmetic and date Yes/No in code
        SVC->>SVC: highlight yellow where delta > $75,000
        SVC->>SP: upload as<br/>"DRS - M.DD.YYYY - Account Name (MM.YYYY)"
        SVC->>AS: link DRS on the task, mark ready for review
        SVC->>AS: Agent stages += drs_done
    else TCV < $250,000 USD
        SVC->>AS: Review Signoff Threshold = "N/A"
        SVC->>AS: Preparer Status = "N/A - below threshold"
        Note right of AS: the task is still fully populated:<br/>period, Delivery Date, Quote Number, Product,<br/>Order Date, SO/RMA, RA number,<br/>Order Type, Currency, TCV bucket
        SVC->>AS: Agent stages += no_drs_below_250k
    end

    SVC-->>TQ: 200, task removed from the queue
